Fixes:
- Write colours with transparency through color-mix instead of appending a hex alpha, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours keep their tints.
- Count time on a clock of 30 frames a second, the rate it was made for, so a 60 fps project plays it at the same speed.
- Time the phases against the clip length times the speed, the clock the frame runs on, so every phase plays at any speed.

